sia tenta di strozzare Lola-Lola.","tagline":"Anche tu sarai eccitato dalla sua bellezza inebriante! \"Questa donna rende un uomo dignitoso schiavo dell'amore!\""},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Blue Angel","overview":"Prim professor Immanuel Rath finds some of his students ogling racy photos of cabaret performer Lola Lola and visits a local club, The Blue Angel, in an attempt to catch them there. Seeing Lola perform, the teacher is filled with lust, eventually resigning his position at the school to marry the young woman. However, his marriage to a coquette -- whose job is to entice men -- proves to be more difficult than Rath imagined.","tagline":"You Too, Will Be Aroused By Her Intoxicating Beauty! \"This Woman Makes a Man of Dignity a Slave to Love!\""},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Der Gymnasialprofessor Rath entdeckt, dass seine Schüler das moralisch anrüchige Lokal „Der blaue Engel“ besuchen. Voller Empörung stellt er dort die Sängerin Lola zur Rede. Doch schon bei der ersten Begegnung erliegt er ihren Reizen. Nach einem zweiten Besuch verbringt er die Nacht in ihrem Bett – nicht ohne Folgen. Am Morgen danach wird er von den Schülern als „Unrat“ verhöhnt. Dem Schuldirektor gegenüber verteidigt er sein Liebesverhältnis und wird entlassen. Erst viel zu spät merkt der Professor, dass ihn seine Liebe zu Lola zielsicher ins Verderben führt …"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ftsx2EdBUrKuhH0YA7tqBwMWtsV.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jLvlD6ABDESFfYl3F1TqCoiBaig.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":228,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ftsx2EdBUrKuhH0YA7tqBwMWtsV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ftsx2EdBUrKuhH0YA7tqBwMWtsV.jpg","language":"it","width":768,"height":1152},"can